    given-names: Jacob
repository-code: "https://github.com/jacobbuildmodel/coe-analysis"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Data and code behind the articles on The New Void Deck
  (https://jacobbuildmodel.github.io): Singapore's favourite arguments, tested
  with public data. Each piece has its own folder; the How to cite section of
  the README lists them with their titles, addresses and the dates their
  predictions were sealed.
keywords:
